      "description": "* Update YARG.Core submodule.\n\n* Add a button in the the score menu to update .ini file using average song offset.\n\n* Add button to apply song offset from score screen\n\n* Only show song calibration buttons if there's only one player and if .ini file exists\n\n* Only show song calibration buttons if on the histogram view (to evaluate if it's preferable)\n\n* Change variable name to avoid collision\n\n* Remove comma in button entry list\n\n* Write to .json file instead of .ini file\n\n* Modified YARG.Core (back to original)\n\n* Song load reads jsons file and adjusts offset\n\n* Add setting to control whether options show. Add French and English localizations for option and buttons.\n\n* Make it so button needs to be held\n\n* Added another option to limit this to one player games\n\n* Fix small bug\n\n* Add player filtering in online mode\n\nAdded TODO comments for future online functionality.\n\n* Replace logging with success toast messages\n\n* Replace YargLogger with ToastManager for error handling\n\n* Log error instead of showing toast on offset load failure\n\n* Change logging method for song offsets loading error\n\n* Improve error message formatting in offset saving\n\n* Add using directive for YARG.Menu.Persistent\n\n* Refactor ToastManager messages to use string interpolation\n\n* Add the option to change the offset of a single song\n\n* Create SongOffsetSetting.cs\n\n* Add quicksettings logic for offset calibration\n\n* Add offset strings\n\n* Add offset calibration option\n\n* Update SongRunner.cs\n\n* Initiate things correctly\n\n* Update GameManager.cs\n\n* Add auto offset calibration to autocalibrator\n\n* Add AutoCalibrateOffset ToggleSetting\n\n* Revert a change that wasn't supposed to be in this PR\n\n* Add a using\n\n* Fix JSON formatting for RemoveSongOffset entry\n\n* Change \"record\" to \"save\"\n\n* Change order of settings\n\nPut the offset calibration in a different category\n\n* Rename header metadata for song offset calibration\n\n* Add Offset Calibration entry to JSON localization\n\n* Add translation for OffsetCalibration in French JSON\n\n* Fixed an issue where the offset calibration number didn't show up if there was more than two players\n\n* Add schedulers for metronome and crowd claps\n\n* Use the new schedulers\n\n* Solve offset json reading: add a fallback\n\n* Change an option to be a dropdown instead of two booleans\n\n* Changed mean to average in locale\n\n* Solved the delay bug in the schedulers by modifying BassOneShotChannel\n\n* Remove useless throw and replace with a return\n\n* Make schedulers even faster\n\n* Remove waiting for video offset if auto calibrating\n\n* Fix video playing when adjusting offset in pause menu\n\n* Use defined songrunner time for video background\n\n* Add ispaused method to YargVideoPlayer since it was used by my last change"
